+assigned names and comparing all new proposed names to the
+database ones.  If the name already exists a new one has to be
+proposed.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.13">Identifiers persistence considerations:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.14">The assignment process guarantees that names are not reassigned.
