+years.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.15">Process of identifiers assignment:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.16">Names are granted via SWIFT proprietary registration procedures.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.17">Process for identifier resolution:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.18">SWIFT URNs are resolved via URN resolvers run under SWIFT
+responsibility.</dd>
